5. Galaxy Arena seasonal bot awards
The proposed schedule is based on the final rankings of eligible member-owned bots:
Finishing place	Proposed award
1st	50,000 TDIA
2nd	25,000 TDIA
3rd	10,000 TDIA
Full award schedule per qualifying season	85,000 TDIA


Multiple-bot ownership rule: Each eligible bot receives its own placement award even when the same member owns other placing bots. If one member owns all three qualifying bots, the member is eligible for 50,000 + 25,000 + 10,000 = 85,000 TDIA, subject to the same approval and payout conditions. Rewards are recorded separately for each qualifying award to prevent duplicates.

Current program status: Season award previews have been implemented and checked locally, but that is not a live on-chain payout system. No award should be described as paid without successful transaction confirmation and reconciliation. Final terms, lawful eligibility, a completed season, wallet verification, owner approval, sufficient reserves, and gas funding are required before transfer.

The Arena uses virtual, nonredeemable chips. TDIA is not an Arena chip, wager, stake, or conversion mechanism for game chips. A purchase, token deposit, token holding, or paid membership is not intended to be required for eligibility under the proposed promotional award policy.
